* Pluto probe: a small made-up frame printed with the usual output commands, so the .anl reader can be
* written against the real layout of every table. Nothing here is from a project.
* Run it in STAAD.Pro as it is and send back the .anl (see README.md beside this file).
INPUT WIDTH 79
UNIT FEET KIP
JOINT COORDINATES
* base
1 0 0 0; 2 20 0 0; 3 40 0 0; 4 0 0 15; 5 20 0 15; 6 40 0 15
* first level
11 0 12 0; 12 20 12 0; 13 40 12 0; 14 0 12 15; 15 20 12 15; 16 40 12 15
* second level (two large numbers, to show the column widths)
21 0 24 0; 22 20 24 0; 23 40 24 0; 24 0 24 15; 25 20 24 15
123456 40 24 15
MEMBER INCIDENCES
* columns
101 1 11; 102 2 12; 103 3 13; 104 4 14; 105 5 15; 106 6 16
111 11 21; 112 12 22; 113 13 23; 114 14 24; 115 15 25
654321 16 123456
* beams along X
201 11 12; 202 12 13; 203 14 15; 204 15 16
211 21 22; 212 22 23; 213 24 25
20001 25 123456
* beams along Z
221 11 14; 222 12 15; 223 13 16
231 21 24; 232 22 25; 233 23 123456
* braces
301 1 12; 302 2 11; 303 4 15; 304 5 14; 305 2 13; 306 5 16
START GROUP DEFINITION
MEMBER
_COLS 101 TO 106 111 TO 115 654321
_BEAMSX 201 TO 204 211 TO 213 20001
_BEAMSZ 221 TO 223 231 TO 233
END GROUP DEFINITION
DEFINE MATERIAL START
ISOTROPIC STEEL
E 4.176e+06
POISSON 0.3
DENSITY 0.489
ALPHA 6.5e-06
DAMP 0.03
END DEFINE MATERIAL
MEMBER PROPERTY AMERICAN
* a group name, a wrapped list, and one shape of each kind
_COLS TABLE ST W10X49
201 TO 204 211 TO 213 -
20001 TABLE ST W16X26
221 222 231 232 TABLE ST W12X26
223 TABLE ST C10X30
233 TABLE T W16X26
301 302 TABLE LD L40404 SP 0.03125
303 TABLE ST L40404
304 TABLE ST HSST6X6X0.375
305 TABLE ST PIPX20
306 PRIS YD 0.5 ZD 0.5
CONSTANTS
MATERIAL STEEL ALL
BETA 90 MEMB 103 106
MEMBER OFFSET
201 START 0.5 0 0
MEMBER RELEASE
221 TO 223 231 TO 233 START MZ
221 TO 223 231 TO 233 END MZ
MEMBER TRUSS
301 TO 306
SUPPORTS
1 2 4 5 FIXED
3 PINNED
6 FIXED BUT MX MZ
LOAD 1 LOADTYPE Dead TITLE DEAD
SELFWEIGHT Y -1
MEMBER LOAD
_BEAMSX UNI GY -0.5
_BEAMSZ UNI GY -0.3
LOAD 2 LOADTYPE Live TITLE LIVE
MEMBER LOAD
_BEAMSX UNI GY -0.8
_BEAMSZ UNI GY -0.4
LOAD 3 LOADTYPE Roof Live TITLE ROOF LIVE
MEMBER LOAD
211 TO 213 20001 UNI GY -0.3
