JOINT LOAD
11 14 FX 5
21 24 FX 8
LOAD 5 LOADTYPE Wind TITLE WIND Z
JOINT LOAD
11 12 13 FZ 4
21 22 23 FZ 6
LOAD 6 LOADTYPE None TITLE REPEAT DEAD AND LIVE
REPEAT LOAD
1 1.0 2 1.0
* strength combinations
LOAD COMB 101 1.4D
1 1.4
LOAD COMB 102 1.2D + 1.6L + 0.5LR
1 1.2 2 1.6 3 0.5
LOAD COMB 103 1.2D + 1.0L + 1.0WX
* a comment between a combination and its factors
